+/*
+ * CN ports mix codepages inside one directory tree: the data was extracted on
+ * Windows with the GBK codepage (so a folder carries the GBK reading of the
+ * original SJIS bytes, e.g. "婄俠俧" for "顔ＣＧ"), while other entries kept
+ * their Japanese kana ("AliceSoft_02_ガード１.png"). Paths coming from the
+ * game are converted with the GBK reading, so a kana name does not match.
+ *
+ * When an exact lookup fails we retry with the other interpretation of the
+ * same bytes and search the parent directory for a matching entry.
